<article id="post-96393" class="post-96393 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-athletics category-mens-baseball category-news">
    <header class="entry-header">
	
		<h1 class="entry-title" style="font-size:2em;"><a href="https://www.ssc.edu/south-suburban-college-baseball-caps-historic-season-with-regional-title-and-dominant-home-record/" rel="bookmark">South Suburban College Baseball Caps Historic Season with Regional Title and Dominant Home Record </a></h1>
	
         
        <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="posted-on">Posted on <time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-05-18T11:50:59-05:00">May 18, 2026</time></span><span class="byline"> by <span class="author vcard">Webmaster</span></span> 
        </div><!-- .entry-meta -->
		<br>
         
    </header><!-- .entry-header -->

     
    <div class="entry-content">
        <p>South Holland, IL — The South Suburban College (SSC) Bulldogs Baseball team delivered a remarkable 2026 season defined by dominance, resilience, and championship success. </p>
<p>Finishing the year with an impressive 42–16 overall record, the Bulldogs captured the Region 4 Championship, marking another milestone in the program’s proud tradition of excellence. The team surged through the latter part of the season on a 17-game winning streak, showcasing depth, discipline, and determination that carried them into postseason play. </p>
<p>The Bulldogs were especially formidable on their home field, going a perfect 20–0 at Steve Ruzich Stadium, turning their home turf into an unbreakable fortress for opponents throughout the season. </p>
<p>Their postseason run advanced to the District Tournament, where the team battled fiercely but concluded play with a 1–2 record against top regional competition. </p>
<p>“This season was a testament to the commitment and hard work of our student-athletes and coaching staff,” said Coach Ruzich. “Their performance on the field and in the classroom reflects the very best of Bulldog pride.” </p>
<p>The 2026 season will be remembered not only for its wins, but for the culture of excellence, teamwork, and perseverance displayed by the players and coaches representing SSC. </p>
<p>As the Bulldogs look ahead to next season, the foundation built this year sets the stage for continued success both on and off the field. </p>
<p>For more information about SSC’s baseball team, contact Coach Steve Ruzich via email at <a title="Steve Ruzich's Email" href="mailto:sruzich@ssc.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa fa-envelope-o"></i> sruzich@ssc.edu</a></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-76861" src="https://www.ssc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/pr-mens-baseball-regional-champs.jpg" alt="2025-2026 South Suburban College Men's Baseball Regional Championship Team Photo" width="300" height="400" /></p>
<p>PHOTO: South Suburban College Baseball Team.</p>
<p><strong>About SSC Baseball</strong><br />
Over the years, SSC Baseball has produced numerous All-Region and All-American players, conference champions, and student-athletes who have advanced to four-year universities and professional opportunities. Guided by experienced coaching and a strong support system, Bulldog student-athletes are prepared to succeed both on the field and beyond the game. To learn more, visit: <a title=" SSC Baseball" href=" https://www.ssc.edu/athletics/baseball/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i> SSC Baseball</a></p>
 
        <div class="clearfix"></div>
         
    </div><!-- .entry-content -->
     

